clockify-mcp
============

This project is a derivative work. It began as a fork of:

    mcp_clockify — https://github.com/aslamanver/mcp_clockify
    Copyright (c) Aslam Anver

The original established the tool surface, the naming convention for the
tools, and the Clockify endpoint mapping this project still follows. The
Clockify API client, pagination, date handling, timer tools, invoicing tools
and test suite in this repository were written for this fork, but the shape of
the thing is his and the credit for it belongs to him.

